-- ACNV2_ONLY C_ADA_ONLY (Issue 125: the PatchDet of a fixed-size consumer of an --acn-v2 reference; legacy: 10-SEQEUENCE/030)
-- Issue 125 (cycle i108a): the patch of a fixed-size consumer (SIZE(3): its value is a constant) runs only when the
-- consumer is encoded. Before, an absent one wrote its constant: with another consumer present with another size the
-- encoding of a valid value failed (203: S10 in the field's function, S13 in the callee), alone it replaced the
-- field's default (S14: n = 3 instead of 0, legacy wrote 0). Inside the elements of the callee's SEQUENCE OF the constant
-- is written also for an empty list (S15, as legacy); next to a direct consumer such an element consumer is patched per
-- element (S16: an empty list with d absent leaves the default 0, where legacy writes 3 and rejects d present with an
-- empty list); S17: the element consumer OPTIONAL inside the element is patched per element too (no element holding it:
-- the default). The variable consumers start at 3 octets, so that automatic values with the fixed-size one present
-- agree with them. Wire bytes: test-cases/acn-wire/011.
TEST-CASE DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS::= BEGIN
    Pay ::= SEQUENCE { d OCTET STRING (SIZE(3..15)) OPTIONAL, e INTEGER (0..255) }
    PayF ::= SEQUENCE { o OCTET STRING (SIZE(3)) OPTIONAL, e INTEGER (0..255) }
    S10 ::= SEQUENCE { o OCTET STRING (SIZE(3)) OPTIONAL, pl Pay, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
    S13 ::= SEQUENCE { pl PayF, d OCTET STRING (SIZE(3..15)) OPTIONAL, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
    S14 ::= SEQUENCE { pl PayF, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
    PG ::= SEQUENCE { items SEQUENCE (SIZE(0..2)) OF OCTET STRING (SIZE(3)) }
    S15 ::= SEQUENCE { pl PG, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
    PGV ::= SEQUENCE { d OCTET STRING (SIZE(0..15)) OPTIONAL, items SEQUENCE (SIZE(0..2)) OF OCTET STRING (SIZE(3)) }
    S16 ::= SEQUENCE { pl PGV, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
    PGX ::= SEQUENCE { items SEQUENCE (SIZE(0..2)) OF SEQUENCE { x OCTET STRING (SIZE(3)) OPTIONAL, e INTEGER (0..255) } }
    S17 ::= SEQUENCE { pl PGX, tail INTEGER (0..255) }
END

--TCFS   046.acn
